    {
      "number": "1",
      "title": "About this guide",
      "sections": [
        {
          "number": "1.1",
          "title": "Purpose and scope",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "This guide explains how to file a request through the portal, from the service card to sending the request, then following it until its final status. It does not cover the work of the staff who review requests."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "1.2",
          "title": "Conventions",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Button and field names appear in « » exactly as the screen shows them. The numbered circles on screenshots match the numbers of the steps. Four kinds of callout appear in the guide.",
                "Note: adds a condition or an explanation.",
                "Tip: shows a quicker way.",
                "Important: something to do before you continue.",
                "Warning: an action that cannot be undone."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "number": "1.3",
          "title": "Terms and abbreviations",
          "blocks": [
