      "number": "5",
      "title": "Steps",
      "sections": [
        {
          "number": "5.1",
          "title": "Filing a request",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "subhead",
              "text": "Step 1: Sign in"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Open the portal and press «Sign in». Enter your user name and password, then press «Continue».",
                "Note: if you forgot your password, press «Forgot password» and follow the message you receive."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "shots",
              "images": [],
              "ratio": "16:10",
              "badge": 1,
              "caption": "Screenshot 1: the sign-in screen"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "columns": [
                "No.",
                "Element on screen",
                "What it does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "«Sign in» button",
                  "Opens the sign-in form."
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "«Continue» button",
                  "Checks your details and opens the portal."
                ]
              ],
              "colWidths": [
                8,
                46,
                46
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "subhead",
              "text": "Step 2: Open the service"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Press the service name in the list and read the service card. Then press «Start request».",
                "Tip: use the search box above the list if the service is not in view."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "shots",
              "images": [],
              "ratio": "16:10",
              "badge": 2,
              "caption": "Screenshot 2: the service card"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "columns": [
                "No.",
                "Element on screen",
                "What it does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "Search box",
                  "Filters the list by name."
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "«Start request» button",
                  "Opens the request form."
                ]
              ],
              "colWidths": [
                8,
                46,
                46
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "subhead",
              "text": "Step 3: Fill in the form"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Fill in the fields of each panel in order. Required fields carry an asterisk. Press «Next» to move to the following panel.",
                "Important: some choices show new fields. See «Choices and what they reveal»."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "shots",
              "images": [],
              "ratio": "16:10",
              "badge": 3,
              "caption": "Screenshot 3: the form"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "columns": [
                "No.",
                "Element on screen",
                "What it does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "Progress bar",
                  "Shows the panel you are on."
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "Required field",
                  "Must be filled before «Next»."
                ]
              ],
              "colWidths": [
                8,
                46,
                46
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "subhead",
              "text": "Step 4: Attach the documents"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Press «Choose file» beside each attachment, pick the file and wait for the green tick.",
                "Note: a file in another format, or over the maximum size, is rejected."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "shots",
              "images": [],
              "ratio": "16:10",
              "badge": 4,
              "caption": "Screenshot 4: the attachments panel"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "columns": [
                "No.",
                "Element on screen",
                "What it does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "1",
                  "«Choose file» button",
                  "Opens your files."
                ],
                [
                  "2",
                  "Green tick",
                  "Confirms the upload."
                ]
              ],
              "colWidths": [
                8,
                46,
                46
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "subhead",
              "text": "Step 5: Review and send"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "paragraphs": [
                "Check the summary, then press «Send».",
                "Warning: a sent request cannot be edited. Check every field before you press «Send»."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "shots",
              "images": [],
              "ratio": "16:10",
